UPDATE companies SET description='AMS Fabrications Inc. was founded in 1984 in Fort Lauderdale, Florida. The company operates as a sheet metal fabrication shop serving a wide range of custom metalwork needs.

The shop provides laser cutting, metal fabrication, robotic welding, MIG/TIG and laser welding, bending and forming, prototyping, 3D scanning, and CAD design using SolidWorks. It also produces hand railings, louver panels, designer gates, and handles structural and architectural metalwork. Its portfolio spans precision sheet metal parts, artistic creations, architectural structures, and fully bespoke aluminum automobiles produced under the Alloy Cars brand.

Clients come from architectural, interior design, artwork, sculpture, marine, solar energy, municipal, and automotive sectors. Concrete projects include hundreds of solar-powered recycling bins installed across South Florida, custom cladding and railings for buildings, marine accessories, kitchen interior pieces, artwork and decor, and the Alloy Cars line of aluminum vehicles.

The company emphasizes a blend of German engineering principles with American craftsmanship, tailoring each project to the customer''s vision. With over 40 years of experience, it positions its longevity and diverse project history as a mark of reliability, describing itself as the highest-rated sheet metal fabrication shop in its market.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Laser cutting", "Metal fabrication", "Robotic welding", "Sheet metal work", "Bending and forming", "MIG welding", "TIG welding", "Laser welding", "Prototyping", "3D scanning", "CAD drawing", "SolidWorks modeling", "Artwork fabrication", "Sculpture fabrication", "Structural fabrication", "Architectural metalwork", "Hand railing fabrication", "Louver panel fabrication", "Designer gate fabrication"], "industries": ["Architectural", "Interior design", "Artwork", "Sculpture", "Marine", "Solar energy", "Municipal", "Automotive"], "materials": ["Stainless steel", "Aluminum"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Combines German engineering principles with American craftsmanship", "Over 40 years of experience in custom metal fabrication", "Produces bespoke aluminum automobiles under the Alloy Cars brand", "Offers in-house 3D scanning and SolidWorks CAD design", "Handles projects from architectural structures to marine accessories"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1984 -> db", "Headquarters in Fort Lauderdale, Florida -> db and page /", "Services: laser cutting, metal fabrication, robotic welding, MIG/TIG welding, laser welding, bending, forming, prototyping, 3D scanning, CAD, SolidWorks -> page /", "Products: hand railings, louver panels, designer gates, architectural metalwork, artwork, sculptures, aluminum automobiles (Alloy Cars) -> page /", "Industries served: architectural, interior design, artwork, sculpture, marine, solar energy, municipal, automotive -> page /", "Materials: stainless steel, aluminum -> page /", "Claim: combines Germ