UPDATE companies SET description='ANZER operates from Akron, Ohio, where it was founded in 1993.

The company provides a full spectrum of electronics assembly services, including surface-mount (SMT), through-hole (THT), and mixed-technology PCB assembly, as well as prototype builds, full production runs, and box-build integration. Its advanced SMT lines handle a range of component types and sizes, supporting scalable production from early-stage prototypes to high-volume orders. Across more than 4,000 completed projects, ANZER serves over 200 customers.

ANZER''s customer base spans aerospace, automotive, agriculture, medical devices, industrial automation, lighting controls, sports technology, consumer electronics, and telecommunications. The company works with organizations developing mission-critical assemblies for flight and space, electronic systems for modern vehicles, durable solutions for farming equipment, precision components for medical innovations, and automated systems for industrial efficiency.

ANZER emphasizes on-time delivery, competitive pricing, and customized solutions tailored to each project. Every product undergoes rigorous testing, and the team holds IPC-A-610 certification to verify workmanship at each stage. The company positions its responsiveness and modern equipment as key differentiators for clients who need reliable, cost-effective manufacturing without sacrificing quality.', certifications=ARRAY['IPC-A-610']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Surface Mount Technology (SMT) Assembly", "Through-Hole Technology (THT) Assembly", "Mixed Technology Assembly", "Prototype PCB Assembly", "High-Volume Production Assembly", "Box-Build Assembly", "Electronic Design Services", "Contract Electronics Manufacturing", "In-Process Quality Verification (IPC-A-610)"], "industries": ["Aerospace", "Automotive", "Agriculture", "Medical Devices", "Industrial Automation", "Lighting Controls", "Sports Technology", "Consumer Electronics", "Telecommunications"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Advanced SMT lines"], "volume": "Prototype to high-volume production", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["On-time delivery commitment", "Advanced SMT lines and modern processes", "Competitive pricing with high quality standards", "Tailored solutions for unique project requirements", "IPC-A-610 certified workmanship verification"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1993 -> db", "Headquarters Akron, Ohio -> db", "33+ years experience -> homepage", "4000+ projects completed -> homepage", "200+ customers -> homepage", "10+ industries served -> homepage", "SMT, THT, mixed technology assembly -> homepage/products", "Prototype to full production runs -> products", "Box-build assembly services -> capabilities", "Industries: aerospace, automotive, agriculture, medical, industrial automation, lighting controls, sports -> homepage", "Consumer electronics, telecommunications -> industries_served", "IPC-A-610 certification mentioned -> blog post", "Advanced SMT lines -> products", "On