UPDATE companies SET description='APE Built operates from Cookeville, Tennessee, where it was founded by veterans and remains veteran-owned and operated. The company began as the original manufacturer of traffic control trailers, a product line it continues to produce alongside its off-road vehicle and drivetrain offerings.

The facility focuses on prototyping and low-rate production for both commercial and government customers.

Customers span municipal and DOT fleets, utility and construction contractors, and defense agencies, with named accounts including Albemarle County Police Department, American Civil Constructors, APAC, and the Miami Dolphins. The company also serves recreational off-road builders through its component index and chassis kits.

