UPDATE companies SET description='AQ Wiring Systems NY operates from Plattsburgh, New York. The business traces its origins to 1991 and became part of the Swedish multinational AQ Group in 2018 following the acquisition of the former B3CG Interconnect. It is now a subsidiary of AQ Group, which employs over 8,000 people across 42 manufacturing sites worldwide.

