UPDATE companies SET description='ARA Food Corporation operates from Miami, Florida, where it was founded in 1975 by Cuban immigrant Alberto R. Abrante and his family. The family-owned business has grown into one of Florida''s largest snack food manufacturers over nearly five decades.

