UPDATE companies SET description='ARE Solar was founded in 2009 in Denver, Colorado, originally as Affordable Alternative Energy before adopting the ARE Solar name—now standing for Advancing Renewable Energy. The locally owned company operates from offices in Denver, Erie, and Larkspur, serving the Front Range region with a focus on commercial and residential solar photovoltaic systems.

The firm provides end-to-end solar services: custom system design, permitting, installation, monitoring, maintenance, repair, and panel removal or reinstallation. Its in-house team includes NABCEP‑certified installers, master electricians, and structural engineers who coordinate every project from initial assessment through long‑term performance support. The company has completed installations for clients ranging from single‑family homes to large‑scale commercial sites such as Denver International Airport.

ARE Solar works with commercial property owners, businesses managing operating costs, and homeowners seeking energy independence across Denver, Boulder, and surrounding Front Range communities.

The company emphasizes local accountability paired with technical depth, citing its lifetime workmanship warranty, manufacturer‑backed equipment warranties, and membership in the Colorado Solar & Storage Association as differentiators. Its founding principle—making renewable energy practical and accessible—continues to guide a process that stays involved from design through activation and ongoing service.', certifications=ARRAY['NABCEP']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar PV system design", "Solar panel installation", "Solar panel removal and reinstallation", "Solar system repair and restoration", "Solar system maintenance and monitoring", "Permitting and utility coordination", "Incentive and financing navigation", "Commercial solar installation", "Residential solar installation"], "industries": ["Commercial", "Residential", "Government / public infrastructure"], "materials": ["Solar PV panels", "Inverters", "Racking and mounting hardware", "Electrical components"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Lifetime workmanship warranty on all installations", "NABCEP\u2011certified installers, master electricians, and structural engineers on staff", "In\u2011house management from design and permitting through long\u2011term monitoring and repair", "Local Colorado ownership with knowledge of regional codes, utilities, and climate", "Member of the Colorado Solar & Storage Association"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2009 as Affordable Alternative Energy -> /about", "Locally owned Colorado company with offices in Denver, Erie, Larkspur -> /about", "NABCEP-certified installers, master electricians, structural engineers on staff -> /about", "Lifetime workmanship warranty on installations -> /about", "Completed commercial solar installation at Denver International Airport -> /", "Member of Colorado Solar & Storage Association -> /about", "Services include design, installation, removal/reinstallation, repair, maintenance/monitorin