UPDATE companies SET description='Able Medical Devices is headquartered in Marquette, Michigan. The company was established in 2017, building on a leadership team that accumulated decades of experience at medical device firms such as RTI Surgical and Pioneer Surgical. No individual founders are named in public materials, and the ownership structure has not been disclosed.

The company specializes in precision-machined surgical implants and instruments, offering services from prototype development through full-scale production. Its 30,000-square-foot facility houses multi-axis CNC Swiss turning centers, 3+2-axis CNC milling, gun drilling, wire EDM, laser welding, surface grinding, and buffing and blasting equipment. The team supports complex instrument assemblies, design control, risk management, and regulatory compliance under ISO 13485:2016 and FDA registration.

Able serves the orthopedic and medical device industries, including cardiothoracic product lines. Its customers are typically companies seeking outsourced design, development, and finished-goods manufacturing for Class I, II, and III devices. The firm emphasizes a scalable lean manufacturing approach refined over 20 years to accelerate speed to market.

The company positions itself as a strategic partner, citing its team’s average 20-plus years of experience and more than $1 billion in product affiliations. It highlights its lean manufacturing heritage, regulatory expertise (QSR, ISO 13485, MDD, MDR preparation), and a quality policy focused on delivering the right product on time.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 13485:2016','FDA registered (#3014680795)']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["CNC Swiss turning (multi-axis)", "CNC milling (3+2 axis)", "Gun drilling", "Wire EDM", "Laser welding", "Surface grinding", "Buffing and blasting", "Prototyping and custom instruments", "Complex instrument assemblies", "Implant manufacturing", "Instrument manufacturing", "Prototype & product development", "Design control and risk management", "Quality systems services", "Regulatory services", "Project management & engineering", "Lean manufacturing methodologies", "Prototyping to full-scale production", "FDA registered facility", "ISO 13485:2016 certified", "QSR, ISO 13485, MDD experience", "MDR preparation background", "Class I, II, and III product history", "Systems development"], "industries": ["Orthopedic", "Medical device", "Cardiothoracic"], "materials": ["Metal", "Plastic"], "equipment": ["CNC Milling (3+2 axis)", "Swiss Turning Centers", "CNC swiss turning (multi-axis)", "CNC milling", "Gun drilling", "Wire EDM", "Laser welding", "Surface grinding", "Buffing and blasting"], "volume": "Prototyping to full-scale production", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Team with average 20+ years of medical device experience", "Over $1 billion in product affiliations", "20 years of lean manufacturing practice", "ISO 13485:2016 certified and FDA registered facility", "Scalable lean processes for faster delivery"], "facts_used": ["Headquartered in Marquette, Michigan -> /about-us", "Established in 2017 -> /about-us", "30,000 sq ft facility -> /about-us", "ISO 13485:2016 certified -> /about-us", "FDA registered # -> /about-u