UPDATE companies SET description='Electro Freeze of New England, operating as Acana Northeast, is based in Pembroke, New Hampshire. The company serves the six New England states—Maine, Vermont, New Hampshire, Connecticut, Rhode Island, and Massachusetts—as an authorized distributor of Electro Freeze soft-serve equipment and Wadden Systems flavoring systems. No founding year or ownership details are publicly disclosed.

