a in Waterbury, Connecticut specializes in manufacturing copper stabilized NbTi and Nb3Sn conductors for a variety of superconducting applications.", "founded_year": "1971", "employee_count": "over 100", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='accurate-wire' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Acme Electric Company has been headquartered in Cedar Rapids, Iowa since 1950, when Donald L. Barrigar purchased Standard Electric and rebranded it as Acme Electric. The family-owned electrical contractor was founded by Barrigar and Howard Smith, and remains under the leadership of the Barrigar family, now in its third generation with Jackson Barrigar serving as president.

The company provides full-service electrical contracting across four divisions: Construction, Engineering, Service, and Energy Solutions. Its teams handle residential wiring, rewiring, panel upgrades, and lighting; commercial alarm systems, power distribution, and building controls; industrial projects for agricultural, fabrication, and telecommunications facilities; and energy solutions including solar design and installation, KOHLER generator installation, EV charging, and battery storage. Pre-construction services such as Building Information Modeling and pre-fabrication support project planning. With more than 125 licensed electricians — each completing a five-year NJATC apprenticeship — and a peak workforce that has exceeded 300, Acme operates throughout the Cedar Rapids–Iowa City corridor.

Acme serves homeowners, businesses, and industrial plants across Eastern Iowa. Residential customers request troubleshooting, remodels, and code updates. Industrial work spans agricultural operations, fabricators, process equipment, and telecommunications infrastructure. The energy division works with both residential and commercial customers to reduce grid reliance through solar, backup power, and EV charging.

Acme emphasizes safety, reporting zero recordable injuries in three of the last five years, and adherence to OSHA and NECA standards. Its mission centers on quality, service, and performance, with core values of ownership, integrity, and reputation. The company aims to be a long-term partner, offering 24/7 emergency response and a design-build-maintain approach that keeps clients from project start through ongoing maintenance.', certifications=ARRAY['OSHA','NECA','NJATC apprenticeship','Iowa state electrical license']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Residential wiring, rewiring, and code updates", "Electrical panel upgrades", "Lighting repair and installation", "Ceiling fan installation", "Outlet and switch repair and installation", "Electrical remodeling", "Commercial alarm systems", "Lighting and lighting controls", "Power distribution", "Network and building systems", "Industrial agricultural electrical systems", "Fabricator facility electrical work", "Process equipment electrical installation", "Telecommunications infrastructure", "Solar design and installation", "Backup generator installation (KOHLER)", "Electric vehicle charging installation", "Battery storage solutions", "Building Information Modeling (BIM)", "Pre-fabrication", "24/7 emergency electrical service", "Design-build-maintain project lifecycle"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial", "Industrial", "Agricultural", "Fabricators", "Process equipment", "Telecommunications", "Energy (Solar, Generator, EV Charging, Battery Storage)"], "materials": ["Electrical wiring", "Solar panels", "Generators", "EV charging equipment"], "equipment": ["KOHLER generators"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned since 1950, now third generation", "125+ licensed electricians with five-year NJATC apprenticeship", "24/7 emergency electrical service", "Full-service divisions: Construction, Engineering, Service, Energy Solutions", "Zero recordable injuries in three of the last five years"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1950 -> /about", "Family-owned -> /about", "Headquarters Cedar Rapids, Iowa -> /", "125+ employees -> /about", "Services: residential, commercial, industrial, energy solutions -> /", "Founders Donald L. Barrigar and Howard Smith -> /about", "Third generation Jackson Barrigar -> /about", "24/7 emergency service -> /", "BIM and pre-fabrication -> /", "Solar, generator, EV charging, battery storage -> /", "OSHA and NECA standards -> /about", "NJATC apprenticeship -> /about", "KOHLER generators -> /"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Acme Electric Company is a family-owned electrical contractor that''s been serving Eastern Iowa''s residential, commercial, and industrial electrical needs for decades.", "founded_year": "1950", "employee_count": "125+", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='acme-electric-company' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Acme Sheet Metals Inc operates from Evansville, Wyoming, serving customers across Wyoming and South Dakota, including the Rapid City and Casper areas.

The company manufactures custom metal roofing and siding products, including a range of steel panels such as standing seam, exposed fastener, wall, roofing, and soffit profiles. Specific panel lines include the PBR Panel, Nail Strip, Pro Panel, Snap Lock, Lo Pro, 7/8″ Corrugated, 7.2 Panel, Mechanical Lock, and Flush Soffit Panel. Production occurs both in the company''s shop and on-site, supported by a quote and takeoff service. Acme reports over 530 projects completed and more than 210 customers served.

