UPDATE companies SET description='Advanced Cable Ties, Inc. operates from Gardner, Massachusetts, where it has produced cable ties and wiring accessories for over 30 years. The company was founded as a domestic manufacturer focused on cable management solutions, though the exact founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed.

