UPDATE companies SET description='Roskam Foods, operating as Advanced Food Technologies, is headquartered in Grand Rapids, Michigan. Founded in 1923, the company began as a single-product operation and has grown into one of the largest multi-category external food manufacturers in the United States, backed by investor-led expansion.

The company provides co-manufacturing services for branded food companies, retailers, and private-label partners across snack foods, confections, frozen meals, pizza dough, dry baking mixes, and cereal and granola. Its processing platforms include twin- and single-screw extrusion, end-to-end bakery processing (mixing, sheeting, proofing, baking, tempering), specialty snack processing (drying, seasoning, air popping), and advanced packaging (stand-up pouches, dual-compartment cups, bag-in-box, bulk super-sacks). In-house engineering handles feasibility studies, line design, and turnkey capital project management. Operations span eight facilities in the U.S. and Canada, totaling over two million square feet of manufacturing and warehouse space, with more than 50 production and packaging lines and a workforce of 2,400-plus employees.

Customers include national retailers, high-growth brands, and private-label programs seeking large-scale, flexible production. Roskam serves categories such as better-for-you, organic, non-GMO, gluten-free, and grain-free formulations, with dedicated peanut-free facilities and controlled allergen handling for peanuts and tree nuts. The company also supports store-brand programs at national-brand quality.

Roskam emphasizes a partner-first mindset built on disciplined execution, continuous improvement, and integrated supply-chain support. Its differentiation rests on SQF Level II and III certification across all sites, in-house R&D from ideation through commercialization, and end-to-end logistics with EDI connectivity, enabling brands to consolidate manufacturing and simplify operations.', certifications=ARRAY['SQF Level II','SQF Level III','USDA Organic','Non-GMO Project Verified','Keto Certified','Fair Trade','Kosher']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Twin and single-screw extrusion", "End-to-end bakery processing", "Specialty snack processing (drying, seasoning, air popping, topical particulate applications)", "Advanced packaging (stand-up resealable pouches, dual-compartment cups, bag-in-box, bulk super-sacks)", "In-house engineering (feasibility studies, line designs, capital assessments, new-product commercialization)", "Turnkey capital project management", "Baked snacks & popcorns", "Frozen foods", "Dry mix blending", "Cereal & granola", "Confectionary", "Better-for-you organic cereals and grains", "Extruded crisps", "Coated puffs", "Allergen management", "Dedicated free zones (peanut-free)", "Packaging design & engineering", "Concept to commercialization", "Scalability testing", "Margin optimization", "Innovation & scale-up R&D"], "industries": ["Snack foods", "Confections and candy", "Frozen meals", "Pizza dough", "Dry baking mixes", "Cereal and granola", "Better-for-you foods", "Organic foods", "Non-GMO foods", "Gluten-free foods", "Grain-free foods"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["All facilities SQF Level II & III certified", "Dedicated peanut-free facilities", "In-house engineering and turnkey capital project management", "End-to-end supply chain & logistics with full EDI capabilities", "Integrated R&D from ideation to commercialization"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1923 -> db", "Headqu